{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/BinderName.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.consumeBinderNameHint?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">consumeBinderNameHint?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">target</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.VCGenM\">VCGenM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Consume the hints of the target, and of either side of `pre ⊑ rhs`. A hint of the precondition\nis consumed before the precondition becomes a hypothesis. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/BinderName.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.consumeBinderNameHint?","kind":"def","line":91,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.consumeBinderNameHint?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/BinderName.lean#L91-L109"}}],"imports":["Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Util","Lean.Meta.BinderNameHint","Lean.Meta.Sym.AlphaShareBuilder","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateMVarsS","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateS"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.BinderName"}